      "content": "but what if i've already done my part? like, i've stayed through the good times and the bad, and now there's nothing left to give. watching everyone struggle just feels like i'm participating in the misery. if the end is inevitable, isn't there some kind of dignity in just choosing a quiet exit before everything turns into nothingness? instead of letting the wreckage swallow you whole?",
